    "title": "Rochester-area animal shelters call for dog adoptions as capacities are stretched thin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Penale ,\n9 hours ago Two Rochester-area animal shelters say they are at or near capacity when it comes to dogs in their care, and are calling on the community to help find them homes. Greece Animal Services says it has exceeded its physical housing capacity. The shelter says overcrowding has strained staff resources and can hurt both the health and adoptability of potential pets. Read full article\n2",
